        <mxCell id="legend" value="Two independent L1 domains: (1) provider 192.168.1.0/24 + VLAN 10 internal via OpenWrt inside bck; (2) untagged PXE L1 via bck USB NIC → L2 switch → all compute nodes. virt01/02 also attach USB NICs to provider L1. virt03 + lab-gpu-0: PXE fabric only (no provider USB)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
